 r←Test_ShowLongMsg_007(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;globalParms;parms;btn
⍝ Exercise "ShowLongMsg" with a callback acting on a button pressed by specifying a non-qualified function name.
⍝ This function is expected to live in the namespace the main GUI method is called from.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 :If batchFlag
     r←∆NoBatchTest
 :Else

     :Repeat
         ⎕←'Note that this test needs you!'
         ⎕←''
         ⎕←'When the GUI appears, perform the following actions:'
         ⎕←' * Press the "Show" button'
         ⎕←' * Press the "OK" button'
     :Until 1 ∆PromptForSuccess'Are you ready?'

     (globalParms parms)←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForShowLongMsg #.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiUtils.GetParms ⍬

     #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
     'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
     #.TEMP.∆MSG←''
     #.TEMP.(⎕IO ⎕ML)←1
     #.TEMP.⎕FX'OnButtonPressed←{' 'n←⍺' 'btn←⍵' 'n.Btn0≡btn:0' '#.TEMP.∆MSG←btn.Caption' '1' '}'

     parms.onButtonPressed←'OnButtonPressed'
     parms.cancelButton←0
     parms.buttons←'OK' 'Show'

     btn←parms #.TEMP.{⍺ #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.ShowLongMsg ⍵}'Are you sure?'
     →T.PassesIf 0=btn
     →T.PassesIf'Show'≡#.TEMP.∆MSG

     r←T._OK

 :EndIf
